  "notes": "Used for both publishing printed materials and issuing official documents.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{発行|はっこう}する (to publish, issue)\n・{発行|はっこう}{部数|ぶすう} (circulation, print run)\n・{発行|はっこう}{日|び} (publication date, issue date)\n・{発行|はっこう}{者|しゃ} (publisher, issuer)\n・{発行|はっこう}{元|もと} (issuing authority)\n・クレジットカードの{発行|はっこう} (credit card issuance)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{出版|しゅっぱん} (publishing - specifically for books)",
